+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 A string with nine fraction digits parses to the same time and millisecond as Moment.js (test/parse.test.js) [AC-1] [AC-2]
+- [ ] 1.2 REGEX_PARSE captures every fraction digit of that string (test/parse.test.js) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Let REGEX_PARSE take any number of fraction digits (src/constant.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Keep the first three fraction digits as the milliseconds (src/index.js)
